      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, so aosp/3323076 did disable the batched descriptor stuff on the host side.  But for older guests, it\u0027s still enabled on the guest side.  Then stuff breaks.\n\nCan you change `capset-\u003evulkanBatchedDescriptorSetUpdate` to `capset-\u003edisableVulkanBatchedDescriptorSetUpdate`?  `capset-\u003edisableVulkanBatchedDescriptorSetUpdate` needs to be off by default.",
      "revId": "82f7407e135b3ac14473f70252d33fcad9d7b44b",
