      "writtenOn": "2024-11-06T18:14:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry, can you expand on this? Are you suggesting to just change the name? \nAs I understand it, capset can be set to 0 or 1 right? What advantage do you see in inverting the name?\n\n```\nmFeatureInfo.hasVulkanBatchedDescriptorSetUpdate \u003d mCaps.vulkanCapset.vulkanBatchedDescriptorSetUpdate;\n```\n\nThis will then just become:\n```\nmFeatureInfo.hasVulkanBatchedDescriptorSetUpdate \u003d !mCaps.vulkanCapset. disableVulkanBatchedDescriptorSetUpdate;\n```",
